  "solution": {
    "text": "Let position vectors of <math><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>D</mi></math> are <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> respectively<br /><math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>⋅</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> … <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>